          "settings": {
            "style": "quote",
            "align": "center",
            "content": "<p>You like to set the tone just right, and pull people into your surroundings - selected ones, of course. Your presence lingers long after you’re gone, just like your fragrance - no one can name, but everyone craves. </p>"
