        "text-2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "style": "quote",
            "align": "center",
            "content": "<p>Mystery and magnetism weave through you effortlessly, as if destiny itself bowed to your rhythm. To experience you in your element, is to witness art in motion: rare, fluid, inspiring.</p>"
