          "type": "read_more",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Read more",
            "content": "<p>The Seducer wears fragrance the way it was meant to be worn — quietly powerful, deliberately laid. Think low-cut amber, dark florals, animalic warmth, a hint of musk that asks the question without answering it. Notes that lean closer rather than announce. This is not perfume to please; it is presence.</p>"
